<title>FINLAND: RESEARCH ALERT - Natwest downgrades Nokia.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Natwest downgrades Nokia.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natwest Securities said on Tuesday it had downgraded its recommendation on Finnish telecoms group Nokia Oy to an &quot;add&quot; from a &quot;buy&quot;.</p>
<p>A Natwest source in London confirmed the downgrade by telephone, but could give no further details.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0247</p>
</text>
